### Base variables
@host = http://localhost:8080
@auth = {{token}}

### -----------------------------
### AUTH CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS
### -----------------------------

### Register a new user
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "name": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Verify OTP
POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "code": ""
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "batman@gmail.com",
  "password": "batmanbatman"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Resend OTP
POST {{host}}/api/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### Complete Onboarding
POST {{host}}/api/auth/onboarding
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "name": "",
  "collegeName": "",
  "rollNumber": "",
  "image": ""
}

### Google Callback (server-side)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/google-callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "AUTH_CODE_FROM_GOOGLE",
  "state": "OPTIONAL_STATE_IF_USED"
}

### -----------------------------
### NOTE CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS
### -----------------------------

### Create Note
POST {{host}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "pdfLink": "",
  "tags": ["math","algebra"],
  "pdfOption": ""
}

### Get My Notes
GET {{host}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Get Note by ID
GET {{host}}/api/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Delete Note
DELETE {{host}}/api/notes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Browse Notes (paginated)
GET {{host}}/api/notes/browse?query=&tag=&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Search Notes (alias)
GET {{host}}/api/notes/search?query=&tag=&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Get Paginated Notes (alias)
GET {{host}}/api/notes/page?query=&tag=&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Get Saved Notes
GET {{host}}/api/notes/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Get Liked Notes
GET {{host}}/api/notes/liked
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}

### Like Note
POST {{host}}/api/notes/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{auth}}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes/2/like
Authorization: Bearer token

### Unlike Note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/2/like
Authorization: Bearer token

### Save Note
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes/3/save
Authorization: Bearer token

### Unsave Note
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/notes/2/save
Authorization: Bearer token



### -----------------------------
### QUIZ CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS (/quiz-generator)
### -----------------------------

### Generate summary
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quiz-generator
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token

{
  "text": "",
  "action": ""
}

### Generate quiz
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quiz-generator
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token

{
  "text": "",
  "action": ""
}

### Get all quizzes of the logged-in user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quiz-generator
Authorization: Bearer token

### Submit quiz for weakness analysis
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quiz-generator/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token

{
  "quizId": 1,
  "answers": [0,1]
}




### -----------------------------
### StUDY PLAN CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS (/study-plans)
### -----------------------------

### 1️⃣ Generate New Study Plan
POST http://localhost:8080/api/study-plans/generate
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weaknessAnalysis": "\n"
}

### 2️⃣ Get All Study Plans
GET http://localhost:8080/api/study-plans
Authorization: Bearer token

### 3️⃣ Get Study Plan By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/study-plans/1
Authorization: Bearer token

### 4️⃣ Update Study Plan Status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/study-plans/1/status
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 5️⃣ Update Study Plan Title
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/study-plans/1/title
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### 6️⃣ Delete Study Plan
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/study-plans/1
Authorization: Bearer token




### -----------------------------
### AI CHATBOT CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS (study-plans/:id)
### -----------------------------

### 2️⃣ Chat with AI tutor (context: user's quiz weaknesses)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai-chat/id
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}




### -----------------------------
### COLLECTIONS CONTROLLER ENDPOINTS
### -----------------------------

### 1️⃣ Create Collection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/collections
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": ""
}

### 2️⃣ Get All Collections
GET http://localhost:8080/api/collections
Authorization: Bearer token

### 3️⃣ Get Collection By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/collections/7
Authorization: Bearer token

### 4️⃣ Update Collection
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/collections/7
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": ""
}

### 5️⃣ Delete Collection
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/collections/1
Authorization: Bearer token

### 6️⃣ Add Item to Collection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/collections/7/items
Authorization: Bearer token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemType": "NOTE",
  "itemId": 1
}

### 7️⃣ Remove Item from Collection
GET http://localhost:8080/api/quiz-generator/test-api-key
Authorization: Bearer token

